<sp who="#AGA"><speaker><hi rendition="#g">Agamemnon</hi>.</speaker><lb/>
<p><stage>tritt na&#x0364;her</stage></p><lb/>
<p>O Weib, was klagst du ungerecht mich an! <lb/>
